#: userland/apps/reliefppt/window.cpp:636
msgid ""
"A native ReliefOS presentation editor.\n"
"Double-click text to edit. Drag handles to resize.\n"
"F5: present · Ctrl+S: save · Esc: finish editing\n"
"Use .rppt to keep editable slides and embedded pictures."
msgstr ""
"ReliefOS 内置演示文稿编辑器。\n"
"双击文字编辑，拖动控制点调整大小。\n"
"F5：放映 · Ctrl+S：保存 · Esc：结束编辑\n"
"保存为 .rppt 可保留可编辑的幻灯片和内嵌图片。"

